# Per-host stack exclusions for the Makefile.
# Copy this file to .stackignore and uncomment the stacks you do NOT want to
# run on this host. One stack directory per line; blank lines and lines
# starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# Matching is prefix-aware: listing a parent dir excludes all nested stacks,
# e.g. "immich" skips immich/server, immich/kiosk and immich/machine-learning.
#
# Preview the effective list with:  make list

# --- Example: a secondary host that serves no media ---
# immich
# jellyfin
# torrent
# arr
